# AI Meeting Copilot

# System Architecture

Version: 1.0

Status: Draft

---

# 1. Purpose

This document defines the complete technical architecture of AI Meeting Copilot.

It serves as the single source of truth for all engineering decisions.

Every component, service, module and future extension should follow the architecture described in this document.

If implementation conflicts with this document, this document takes precedence.

---

# 2. Architecture Goals

The architecture is designed around the following principles.

- Low latency
- Modular
- Privacy First
- Local First
- Provider Agnostic
- Event Driven
- Extensible
- Testable
- AI Native

---

# 3. High Level Overview

The application listens to meeting audio, transforms speech into structured knowledge, enriches it using AI services, and presents only the most relevant information to the user.

The assistant never joins meetings as a participant.

The assistant only observes locally available audio streams.

---

