# 14. Voice Activity Detection (VAD)

## Purpose

Running Speech-to-Text continuously is computationally expensive.

Voice Activity Detection determines whether someone is actually speaking.

Only speech segments are forwarded.

Silence is discarded.

---

## Responsibilities

Detect

- speech start
- speech end
- pauses
- silence

---

## Configuration

Speech Threshold

Configurable

Minimum Speech Duration

Configurable

Maximum Silence

Configurable

---

## Output

Speech Segment

↓

Event Bus

---

# 15. Speech Recognition Service

## Purpose

Convert speech into text.

The Speech Recognition Service is completely isolated from downstream AI services.

It only performs transcription.

---

## Preferred Engine

Default

Faster Whisper

Alternative Providers

- Whisper.cpp
- OpenAI Whisper API
- Azure Whisper
- Future providers

---

## Streaming Mode

The service should support streaming transcription.

Small transcript updates are preferred over waiting for complete sentences.

Example

```
Wir

↓

Wir möchten

↓

Wir möchten gerne

↓

Wir möchten gerne verstehen

↓

...
```

This significantly reduces latency.

---

## Output

Transcript Event

Contains

- transcript_id
- text
- confidence
- language
- speaker
- timestamps

---

# 16. Transcript Buffer

## Purpose

Speech Recognition produces fragmented text.

The Transcript Buffer combines fragments into meaningful sentences.

---

## Responsibilities

- merge partial transcripts
- remove duplicates
- detect completed sentences
- preserve timestamps

---

## Example

Incoming

```
Wir möchten

Wir möchten gerne

Wir möchten gerne verstehen

Wir möchten gerne verstehen wie

Wir möchten gerne verstehen wie Ihr System funktioniert
```

Output

```
Wir möchten gerne verstehen wie Ihr System funktioniert.
```

---

## Buffer Strategy

The buffer should be configurable.

Possible triggers

- silence
- punctuation
- timeout
- speaker change

---

# 17. Context Window Manager

## Purpose

LLMs require context.

The Context Window Manager determines which previous transcript segments should accompany the current request.

---

## Responsibilities

Maintain

- current discussion
- previous speaker
- unresolved questions
- technical terms
- conversation history

---

## Sliding Window

Instead of sending the entire meeting,

only the most relevant recent context should be used.

Example

Last 5 minutes

or

Last 20 transcript blocks

---

## Context Priorities

Highest

Current speaker

↓

Current topic

↓

Previous question

↓

Previous answer

↓

Meeting history

---

## Context Compression

Older conversations should be summarized before being reused.

Never resend raw transcripts indefinitely.

---

