---

Each processor receives structured input.

Each processor returns structured output.

Processors never modify each other's data.

---

## Failure Isolation

If Translation fails

↓

Question Detection should continue.

If Reply Coach fails

↓

Meeting Summary should continue.

Every processor should fail independently.

