# 43. Architecture Summary

AI Meeting Copilot is built around a modular event-driven architecture.

Every capability is implemented as an independent processor.

The system is provider agnostic.

The system is privacy first.

The system is local first.

The system is designed for continuous evolution.

Its primary objective is not replacing human communication.

